        "claim": "A negative deadline is not treated as an already-expired deadline: the check `elapsed + delay >= deadline` can be false for negative `deadline`, so the helper may sleep and make further calls even though the deadline is in the past. The docstring says `deadline` limits total time and explicitly notes 0 is valid, so negative values should at least not allow sleeping past an expired deadline.",
        "severity": "medium",
        "status": "dropped",
